[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a, 1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Climate control fan control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890436\">H81</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Air conditioner/heater control light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890343\">G45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the flap operating cables (2a) from the retainers\n(2b).</p><p>3. Recover the controls mounting.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035308.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the controls mounting\nis not damaged.</p><p>Position the flap operating cables in the\nretainers.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p>Check that the controls are working properly.</p>"]]